  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Linh Kim",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Denise Arruda",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-05T11:22:32-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Denise."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-05T11:22:35-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, sorry, I'm whispering. Someone's asleep. I'm calling about a streetlight that keeps flickering."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-05T11:22:40-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No problem, I can hear you fine. Where is the light?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-05T11:22:45-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's by 50 Spring Street. In front of the house, on the pole at the curb."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-05T11:22:51-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, 50 Spring Street. Is it out completely, or just flickering?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-05T11:22:55-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Flickering. It goes on and off all night. Every few seconds, really. It lights up the whole bedroom."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-05T11:23:02-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yep, that's usually a bad bulb or a connection. Has it been going on a while?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-05T11:23:08-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "[pause] Just the last few nights. Can you have a crew check the pole?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-05T11:23:13-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'll put in a work order for a crew to look at it. Do you want a call back, or is that enough?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-05T11:23:21-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No call back needed. But my number is 401-555-0151 if they have questions."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-05T11:23:26-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it. They'll get to it as they can."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-05T11:23:30-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Thank you. Bye."
    }
  ],
